keep the backend's test helpers out of the build

`blue_light_tests` (0026) and `direct_path_tests` (0032) were declared
without #[cfg(test)], so they compiled into the device binary and
`cargo clippy -D warnings` failed on their unused imports and helpers --
CLAUDE.md asks for clippy-clean, and a gate that is always red is one
nobody reads. Both are test modules and now say so; the same file is
rustfmt'd where earlier patches left it unformatted. No behaviour changes.

Applies on top of 0041, upstream 91499a9.

